msgid "Configure the autopilot by setting these parameters:"
msgstr "通过设置以下参数来配置飞控："

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-shutter-with-servo.rst:24
#: 0bfc188945a14c9880c9e149bd01f515 19715e66668e4df599adef1e82fca013
